# Ignore build outputs
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Ignore Visual Studio and IDE files
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Ignore NuGet packages and caches
*.nupkg
packages/
project.lock.json
*.psmdcp

# Ignore test results and coverage
TestResults/
coverage*

